{
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "slug": "file-tile",
  "title": "File tile",
  "group": "Data display",
  "order": 20,
  "summary": {
    "en": "Files and folders as tiles in a grid: a tinted thumbnail by type (or the picture itself), a two-line name, size and date, a checkbox that appears on hover, focus or while selecting, and a more menu. The tile opens the file; ticking selects it for a bulk action.",
    "id": "Berkas dan folder sebagai tile dalam grid: thumbnail bertint menurut jenis (atau gambarnya sendiri), nama dua baris, ukuran dan tanggal, kotak centang yang muncul saat hover, fokus, atau selama memilih, dan menu lainnya. Tile membuka berkas; mencentangnya memilih berkas untuk aksi massal."
  },
  "titleId": "File tile",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "A shared folder",
        "desc": "Hover a tile for its checkbox and menu. Tick one: every checkbox stays visible and the selection bar rises with a rolling count. Shift-click ticks a run; Escape clears.",
        "html": "<div class=\"viewport docs-box\" style=\"height: 470px; width: 100%;\"><div class=\"viewport__content\" style=\"overflow: auto; align-items: stretch;\">\n<div class=\"file-grid\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Q4 planning\" data-lds-selection=\"ft-bar\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\n  <div class=\"file-tile file-tile--folder\" role=\"listitem\">\n    <label class=\"check file-tile__check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-lds-select aria-label=\"Select Receipts\"><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path><path class=\"dash\" d=\"M3 7 L11 7\"></path></svg></span></label>\n    <a class=\"file-tile__open\" href=\"#ft-1\"><span class=\"file-tile__thumb\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">folder</span></span><span class=\"file-tile__name\">Receipts</span><span class=\"file-tile__meta\">48 files</span></a>\n    <button class=\"icon-btn file-tile__more\" aria-label=\"More actions for Receipts\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-lds-menu=\"ft-m-1\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">more_horiz</span></button>\n    <div class=\"menu menu--right\" id=\"ft-m-1\" role=\"menu\" aria-label=\"Receipts\" style=\"top: 44px; right: 4px;\">\n      <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">download</span>Download</button>\n      <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">edit</span>Rename</button>\n      <div class=\"menu__sep\"></div>\n      <button class=\"menu__item menu__item--danger\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span>Delete</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"file-tile file-tile--folder\" role=\"listitem\">\n    <label class=\"check file-tile__check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-lds-select aria-label=\"Select Contracts\"><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path><path class=\"dash\" d=\"M3 7 L11 7\"></path></svg></span></label>\n    <a class=\"file-tile__open\" href=\"#ft-2\"><span class=\"file-tile__thumb\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">folder</span></span><span class=\"file-tile__name\">Contracts</span><span class=\"file-tile__meta\">12 files</span></a>\n    <button class=\"icon-btn file-tile__more\" aria-label=\"More actions for Contracts\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-lds-menu=\"ft-m-2\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">more_horiz</span></button>\n    <div class=\"menu menu--right\" id=\"ft-m-2\" role=\"menu\" aria-label=\"Contracts\" style=\"top: 44px; right: 4px;\">\n      <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">download</span>Download</button>\n      <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">edit</span>Rename</button>\n      <div class=\"menu__sep\"></div>\n      <button class=\"menu__item menu__item--danger\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span>Delete</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"file-tile file-tile--sheet\" role=\"listitem\">\n    <label class=\"check file-tile__check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-lds-select aria-label=\"Select Budget Q4 2026.xlsx\"><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path><path class=\"dash\" d=\"M3 7 L11 7\"></path></svg></span></label>\n    <a class=\"file-tile__open\" href=\"#ft-3\"><span class=\"file-tile__thumb\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">description</span></span><span class=\"file-tile__name\">Budget Q4 2026.xlsx</span><span class=\"file-tile__meta\">214 KB · Edited 2 h ago</span></a>\n    <button class=\"icon-btn file-tile__more\" aria-label=\"More actions for Budget Q4 2026.xlsx\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-lds-menu=\"ft-m-3\"><spa